  "version": 1,
  "notes": "The mega wealthy can afford a yacht, but the wealthy need more than a ships boat. The Roam Pod fits between the 2 and can be transported via many large Merchant or Carrier Vessels.\n\nThe ship is configured as an open bridge / common area with 2 state rooms on each side. One side is nornally the owners suite. 1 stateroom for crew or guests and 1 left as an office/workshop/galley, but can be easily reconfigured to suit. \n\nThe virtual crew allow the vessel to be operated solo by anyone in normal situations.\n\nThese plans laid down by COTS who require the upgraded sensors - Many others choose basic sensors which reduces cost, but not tonnage.",
